{
    "title": "JunyTony- Learning & Games!",
    "description": "Choopy-choopy-choopy-choo!\r\n\r\nYou can meet little twin wizards JunyTony in the app now!\r\nFor children\u2019s fun learning, we put all the various music and videos created by early childhood education experts in this app!\r\n\r\nWorried about your children watching content without any educational value in them?\r\nAll JunyTony videos contain fun lessons!\r\n\r\nJunyTony provides content to learn language, numbers, multiplications, moral lessons, safety rules, and dance songs that children will love to learn.\r\nThere are also actual ballet classes of 'JunyTony Ballet Star'.\r\n\r\nFor children\u2019s smiles, for adults\u2019 happiness!\r\nDownload the JunyTony app now and enjoy it with all your family members!\r\nDevelop creativity and sensitivity while singing and dancing together with JunyTony.\r\nStay tuned for more new JunyTony content!\r\n\r\n\r\n \u2022 Enjoy all this fun content on the JunyTony app!\r\n- Peek a Boo, Pick a Song\r\n- ABC Phonics, Super Phonics\r\n- My First Math\r\n- JunyTony Ballet Star\r\n- Green, Green Earth\r\n- Safety Is My Bestie\r\n- Curi-Curi-Curious\r\n- Animal Kingdom\r\n- Little Tourists\r\n- Do It, Do It, Languages \r\n-JunyTony Story Musical \r\n- Cutie-Crawlies\r\n- What Do You Want to Be?\r\n- Time to Explore\r\n- The Dos and Don\u2019ts\r\n- The Greatest Match\r\n- My Amazing Body \r\n- Dinosaur Friends\r\n- Vroom Vroom Vehicles \r\n\r\n*Please note that while the app description is available in English, the app\u2019s content is in English, Spanish, Portuguese, Korean and Indonesian.\r\n\r\nOur goal is to create children\u2019s content that the whole family can enjoy and trust.\r\nWe hope all children will enjoy, learn, grow and have fun with the JunyTony content.\r\n\r\n\r\n\u2022 Meet JunyTony on\r\n-Instagram\r\n@junytony_official\r\n\r\n\r\n\u2022 JunyTony App Subscription Information\r\n- By subscribing to the JunyTony App, you will get unlimited access to all the content on our platform.\r\n- Choose one of the JunyTony app's subscription plans (1 month, six months, 1-year regular subscription), and you'll get a free 7-day trial period.\r\n(There is no automatic payment if you cancel your subscription at least 24 hours before the seven-day free trial period ends.)\r\n- Automatic subscription renewal and payment will be processed 24 hours before the selected subscription plan period ends.\r\n- The app subscription fee will be charged to your chosen iTunes account, and you can manage your subscription at any time through your iTunes account settings after payment.\r\n- If you cancel your app subscription through your iTunes account settings, you will not be charged from the next payment date, and the current subscription period is non-refundable.\r\n\r\n\r\n\u2022 Terms of Use and Privacy Policy\r\nPlease refer to the link to the terms and conditions below.\r\nRead our terms of use and privacy policy:\r\n\r\nterms-of-use: \r\nhttps://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/\r\nprivacy-policy: \r\nhttps://wonderz.eu/kizcastle-privacy-policy\r\n\r\n\r\n\u2022 Contact us:\r\nEmail: app@kizcastle.com\r\nAddress: 7-5, Banpo-daero 20-gil, Seocho-gu, Seoul, Republic of Korea\r\n\r\nPlease contact us through email if you experience any issues with the app or have any questions.\r\nWe will respond to your inquiry as soon as possible.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Choopy-choopy-choopy-choo!<br><br>You can meet little twin wizards JunyTony in the app now!<br>For children\u2019s fun learning, we put all the various music and videos created by early childhood education experts in this app!<br><br>Worried about your children watching content without any educational value in them?<br>All JunyTony videos contain fun lessons!<br><br>JunyTony provides content to learn language, numbers, multiplications, moral lessons, safety rules, and dance songs that children will love to learn.<br>There are also actual ballet classes of &#39;JunyTony Ballet Star&#39;.<br><br>For children\u2019s smiles, for adults\u2019 happiness!<br>Download the JunyTony app now and enjoy it with all your family members!<br>Develop creativity and sensitivity while singing and dancing together with JunyTony.<br>Stay tuned for more new JunyTony content!<br><br><br> \u2022 Enjoy all this fun content on the JunyTony app!<br>- Peek a Boo, Pick a Song<br>- ABC Phonics, Super Phonics<br>- My First Math<br>- JunyTony Ballet Star<br>- Green, Green Earth<br>- Safety Is My Bestie<br>- Curi-Curi-Curious<br>- Animal Kingdom<br>- Little Tourists<br>- Do It, Do It, Languages <br>-JunyTony Story Musical <br>- Cutie-Crawlies<br>- What Do You Want to Be?<br>- Time to Explore<br>- The Dos and Don\u2019ts<br>- The Greatest Match<br>- My Amazing Body <br>- Dinosaur Friends<br>- Vroom Vroom Vehicles <br><br>*Please note that while the app description is available in English, the app\u2019s content is in English, Spanish, Portuguese, Korean and Indonesian.<br><br>Our goal is to create children\u2019s content that the whole family can enjoy and trust.<br>We hope all children will enjoy, learn, grow and have fun with the JunyTony content.<br><br><br>\u2022 Meet JunyTony on<br>-Instagram<br>@junytony_official<br><br><br>\u2022 JunyTony App Subscription Information<br>- By subscribing to the JunyTony App, you will get unlimited access to all the content on our platform.<br>- Choose one of the JunyTony app&#39;s subscription plans (1 month, six months, 1-year regular subscription), and you&#39;ll get a free 7-day trial period.<br>(There is no automatic payment if you cancel your subscription at least 24 hours before the seven-day free trial period ends.)<br>- Automatic subscription renewal and payment will be processed 24 hours before the selected subscription plan period ends.<br>- The app subscription fee will be charged to your chosen iTunes account, and you can manage your subscription at any time through your iTunes account settings after payment.<br>- If you cancel your app subscription through your iTunes account settings, you will not be charged from the next payment date, and the current subscription period is non-refundable.<br><br><br>\u2022 Terms of Use and Privacy Policy<br>Please refer to the link to the terms and conditions below.<br>Read our terms of use and privacy policy:<br><br>terms-of-use: <br>https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/<br>privacy-policy: <br>https://wonderz.eu/kizcastle-privacy-policy<br><br><br>\u2022 Contact us:<br>Email: app@kizcastle.com<br>Address: 7-5, Banpo-daero 20-gil, Seocho-gu, Seoul, Republic of Korea<br><br>Please contact us through email if you experience any issues with the app or have any questions.<br>We will respond to your inquiry as soon as possible.",
